d 'TSURCOINT': module to perform Time-series unit-root and cointegration tests  
d
d	tsurcoint collects, under one command, the time-series
d tests of the GAUSS libraries tspdlib 3.0.0 (Saban Nazlioglu) and 
d   carrionlib 1.0.2 (Josep Lluis Carrion-i-Silvestre) that were
d not yet available in Stata, plus the GLS break models that were  
d  only partly available. Every subcommand is a line-by-line port
d of the GAUSS procedure, written in Mata, including the GAUSS	 
d interior-point quantile-regression solver, and reproduces the
d GAUSS results to 10 decimals. 
d
d KW:  cointegration
d KW: unit root tests
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261112
d
d Author:   Merwan Roudane, NA
d Support: email  merwanroudane920@@gmail.com
d
f tsurcoint.ado
f tsurcoint.sthlp
f tsurcoint_cissanso.sthlp
f tsurcoint_example.do
f tsurcoint_fkss.sthlp
f tsurcoint_fwadf.sthlp
f tsurcoint_fwkss.sthlp
f tsurcoint_glsbreak.sthlp
f tsurcoint_qfkss.sthlp
f tsurcoint_qks.sthlp
f tsurcoint_qkss.sthlp
f tsurcoint_shin.sthlp
f tsurcoint_wkss.sthlp
f ../_/_tsurcoint_glsbreak.ado
f ../_/_tsurcoint_kpssc.ado
f ../_/_tsurcoint_kss.ado
f ../_/_tsurcoint_qkss.ado
